    "status" : "generated",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements InitiateVHLGenerationRequest</b></p><a name=\"InitiateVHLGenerationRequest\"> </a><a name=\"hcInitiateVHLGenerationRequest\"> </a><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-VHLHolder.html\">VHL Holder</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"initiate-request\"> </a></b>Initiate Request</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Initiate a request to generate a Verified Health Link (VHL)</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div>"
